msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "Atari - 7800 (ProSystem)"
msgstr "雅达利 - 7800（ProSystem）"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "ProSystem is an Atari 7800 emulator.[CR][CR]Place [I]7800 BIOS (U).rom[/I] (optional) in the emulator's userdata folder."
msgstr "ProSystem 是雅达利 7800 模拟器。[CR][CR]将 [I]7800 BIOS (U).rom[/I]（可选）放到模拟器的 userdata 文件夹中。"

